{"title":"Avoid AI Slop","html":"<main><div class=\"catalog-page aif-catalog-page\"><div class=\"catalog-layout\"><aside class=\"catalog-sidebar\"><nav class=\"cat-chips\" aria-label=\"Avoid AI Slop\"><button type=\"button\">English AI slop</button><button type=\"button\">UI defaults</button><button type=\"button\">UX shortcuts</button></nav></aside><div class=\"grid-wrap\"><header class=\"aif-catalog-heading\"><p>AI slop field guide</p><h1>Avoid AI Slop</h1><div>Browse recurring writing tells, UI defaults, and UX shortcuts like glossary entries. Each entry includes examples, valid uses, and a concrete revision rule.</div><small>One word, visual choice, or interaction bug cannot prove authorship. Judge repeated defaults in context.</small></header><section class=\"cat-section\" id=\"aif-category-en\"><div class=\"cat-title aif-cat-title\"><div>English AI slop<small>Abstract boosters and universal openings</small></div><span>4 patterns</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"abstract-boosters\"><a href=\"#aif-abstract-boosters\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Abstract Boosters</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">This sounds impressive, but I still cannot tell what the product actually does.</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-abstract\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Abstract Boosters</span><p>Unlock your potential and elevate the experience.</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"delve\"><a href=\"#aif-delve\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Stock Analysis Verb</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">Can you just get to the point instead of opening with “Let’s delve into…”?</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-delve\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Stock Analysis Verb</span><p>Let’s delve into this fascinating topic.</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"landscape-tapestry\"><a href=\"#aif-landscape-tapestry\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Decorative Abstractions</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">What does this actually mean? Please drop the landscape and tapestry metaphors.</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-landscape\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Decorative Abstractions</span><p>Navigate the intricate tapestry of a changing landscape.</p><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"in-todays-world\"><a href=\"#aif-in-todays-world\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Universal Opening</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">Skip the broad opening and tell me what has actually changed.</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-opening\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Universal Opening</span><p>In today’s fast-paced, ever-evolving world…</p><i></i></div></div></a></article></div></section><section class=\"cat-section\" id=\"aif-category-ui\"><div class=\"cat-title aif-cat-title\"><div>UI defaults<small>Repeated structures, decoration, and generic icons</small></div><span>8 patterns</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"centered-hero\"><a href=\"#aif-centered-hero\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Centered Hero Default</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">Can we show the product first? Right now it is just another big headline with two buttons.</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-centered\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><small>AI POWERED</small><strong>Build the future.</strong><p>Everything your team needs.</p><div><i></i><i></i></div></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"three-equal-cards\"><a href=\"#aif-three-equal-cards\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Three-card Default</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">These three things are not equally important. Why do they all get the same card?</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-three-cards\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i><b></b><span></span><span></span></i><i><b></b><span></span><span></span></i><i><b></b><span></span><span></span></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"purple-glow\"><a href=\"#aif-purple-glow\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Purple Glow Default</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">Why is everything glowing purple? It does not look like our brand.</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-glow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><strong>Next-gen platform</strong><span></span></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"rounded-everything\"><a href=\"#aif-rounded-everything\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Nested Containers</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">The outer panel already has a boundary. Why are there three more cards inside it?</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-rounded\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><span>Project overview</span><i><em>This week</em><b>8 tasks done</b></i></div></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"divider-everywhere\"><a href=\"#aif-divider-everywhere\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Divider Everywhere</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">These items already belong together. Why is there a rule between every two lines?</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-divider-everywhere\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><strong>Notifications</strong><p><span>Email updates</span><b>On</b></p><p><span>Product news</span><b>Off</b></p><p><span>Weekly summary</span><b>On</b></p></div></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"left-border-callouts\"><a href=\"#aif-left-border-callouts\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Left-border Callout Default</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">These are ordinary descriptions. Why does every block need a colored line on the left?</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-left-border-callouts\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><strong>Release details</strong><div><p><b>Scope</b><span>Current project only</span></p><p><b>Sync</b><span>After saving</span></p><p><b>Release</b><span>Friday at 18:00</span></p></div></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"heavy-headline\"><a href=\"#aif-heavy-headline\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Heavy Headline</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">This heading is huge, heavy, and cramped. Can we make the two lines readable first?</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-heavy-headline\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><strong>Every meeting<br>moves work forward</strong><p>Turn recordings into decisions and assigned actions.</p></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"emoji-icons\"><a href=\"#aif-emoji-icons\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Emoji as Icons</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">Can we lose the rockets and sparkles? They make the feature cards look generic.</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i><b>🚀</b><span>FAST</span></i><i><b>✨</b><span>SMART</span></i><i><b>🛡️</b><span>SAFE</span></i></div></div></a></article></div></section><section class=\"cat-section\" id=\"aif-category-ux\"><div class=\"cat-title aif-cat-title\"><div>UX shortcuts<small>Copy and interactions that ignore the real task</small></div><span>6 patterns</span></div><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"motion-everywhere\"><a href=\"#aif-motion-everywhere\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Motion Everywhere</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">I am just reading the page. Why does every section have to move before it appears?</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-motion\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Read the update</span><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"fake-responsive\"><a href=\"#aif-fake-responsive\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Fake Responsive Layout</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">The sidebar, table, and buttons are all squeezed into one long mobile page. It is harder to use than desktop.</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-responsive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"aif-phone-bar\"></div><div class=\"aif-phone-side\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"aif-phone-main\"><strong>Orders</strong><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><b>Review order</b></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"description-everywhere\"><a href=\"#aif-description-everywhere\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Description Everywhere</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">These category names are already clear. Why add “Manage your knowledge here” above them?</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-sidebar-copy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><strong>Workspace</strong><p>Manage your knowledge and ideas here.</p><ul><li class=\"is-current\"><b>Recent notes</b><span>Notes you opened recently</span></li><li><b>Projects</b><span>Organize notes by project</span></li><li><b>Archive</b><span>Notes you no longer need</span></li></ul></div><section><b>Recent notes</b><i></i><i></i><i></i></section></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"naming-drift\"><a href=\"#aif-naming-drift\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Naming Drift</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">This says New, the empty state says Add, and the dialog says Create. Are they the same action?</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-naming-drift\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><small>Sidebar</small><b>New note</b></div><div><small>Empty state</small><b>Add page</b></div><div><small>Dialog</small><b>Create document</b></div></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"inert-controls\"><a href=\"#aif-inert-controls\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Inert Controls</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">Nothing changes when I click this filter. Why make it look functional?</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-inert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><span>All</span><span>Pending</span><span>Export</span></div><p>8 items</p><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></a></article><article class=\"card aif-term-card\" data-id=\"icon-button-maze\"><a href=\"#aif-icon-button-maze\"><div class=\"card-head\"><div class=\"card-title-group\"><h3>Icon Button Maze</h3></div></div><div class=\"card-tagline card-quote\">I cannot tell which icon deletes the item, and there is no hover hint on a phone.</div><div class=\"card-demo\"><div class=\"aif-entry-preview aif-preview-icon-maze\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>Project actions</p><div><span>✎</span><span>⧉</span><span>↗</span><span>⌁</span><span>×</span></div></div></div></a></article></div></section></div></div></div></main>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/en/anti-ai-flavor"}